WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,140
Zhang Yi, don’t be arrogant

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:06,940
I'll kill you right away

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,220
Lian must die to pay for my brother's life

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:18,720
what door is this

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,320
Why is it so strong?

6
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:23,410
at this speed

7
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,850
When can I break down the door?

8
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:34,240
This is the security door of a bank vault.

9
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,860
So this thing can't be broken?

10
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:39,340
Not to mention hitting it with a square cloth

11
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,220
This top-notch security door

12
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,340
Even if you use bombs, you can't blow it up.

13
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,540
If there is no key

14
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:47,580
Unless you are the world's top lockpicking expert

15
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,980
Only then is there a chance to open it up
